ansparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">To make a private GitHub repository public:</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>On GitHub.com:</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to your repository page</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Settings</strong> (top menu)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Scroll down to the <strong>Danger Zone</strong> section at the bottom</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Change visibility</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Select <strong>Change to public</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Type the repository name to confirm</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>I understand, change repository visibility</strong></li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Things to keep in mind before switching:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">All commit history, issues, and pull requests will become publicly visible</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">If you have any secrets, API keys, or sensitive data in the code or commit history, remove them first (simply deleting a file isn't enough — the history is still visible)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">You can switch back to private at any time from the same settings</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Using GitHub CLI</strong> (if you prefer the terminal):</p>
<div role="group" aria-label="bash code" tabindex="0" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="sticky opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button class="inline-flex
