<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Open your project in <strong>VS Code</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">In the <strong>Explorer panel</strong>, click <strong>New File</strong> icon</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Name it exactly <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.gitignore</code> (with the dot)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Paste this inside:</li>
</ol>
