<h2 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">3. ✅ Check MongoDB allows Render IP</h2>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to <strong>MongoDB Atlas</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Network Access</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Add IP Address</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Select <strong>Allow Access from Anywhere</strong> → <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">0.0.0.0/0</code></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Confirm</strong></li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h2 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">4. ✅ Check Render Logs for exact error</h2>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to <strong>Render Dashboard</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click your service</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Logs</strong> tab</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Look for the red error message</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
