<h2 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 2: Add Environment Variables on Render</h2>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://render.com/">render.com</a></strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click your <strong>portfolio backend service</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Environment</strong> tab on the left</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Add Environment Variable</strong> and add these one by one:</li>
