<h2 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 3: Fix MongoDB Atlas Network Access</h2>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://cloud.mongodb.com/">cloud.mongodb.com</a></strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Select your project</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Network Access</strong> (left sidebar)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Add IP Address</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Allow Access from Anywhere</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Confirm</strong></li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
