<h2 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Why it looks like nothing changed?</h2>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">GitHub might be showing a <strong>cached view</strong>. Try this:</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h2 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 1: Hard Refresh GitHub Page</h2>
