<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Press <strong>Ctrl + Shift + R</strong> (Windows)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">or <strong>Cmd + Shift + R</strong> (Mac)</li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
